{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01721",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.92,
      "end_seconds": 3.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 4.4,
      "end_seconds": 9.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.39,
      "end_seconds": 17.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair. Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.92,
      "end_seconds": 26.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.25,
      "text": "I mean, honestly, it's sore knees, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 27.68,
      "end_seconds": 37.71,
      "duration_seconds": 10.03,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Weight 80 kilos, height 162 centimetres, pulse 74, temperature 36.7, blood pressure 152 over 97."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.71,
      "end_seconds": 44.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.26,
      "end_seconds": 49.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Erm, I'd say three days, maybe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 50.47,
      "end_seconds": 54.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Hm, I'd say more like five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.02,
      "end_seconds": 59.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to five days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.39,
      "end_seconds": 65.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "So, you know, yes, somewhere around that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.05,
      "end_seconds": 69.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.73,
      "end_seconds": 75.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "It happens a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.73,
      "end_seconds": 83.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "And, And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 83.75,
      "end_seconds": 90.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Erm, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.89,
      "end_seconds": 101.33,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "Erm, I was getting to that! Let me think, and I've been snoring as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 103.05,
      "end_seconds": 105.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.78,
      "end_seconds": 111.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "A few quick ones: chest pain, low mood or high thirst?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.77,
      "end_seconds": 128.33,
      "duration_seconds": 15.56,
      "text": "Ah, no, no chest pain, no low mood, no high thirst. I was putting on weight over the years at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.92,
      "end_seconds": 132.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Did you notice any palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.44,
      "end_seconds": 136.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Not at all, no palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.06,
      "end_seconds": 139.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.13,
      "end_seconds": 141.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.08,
      "end_seconds": 148.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "So, any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.28,
      "end_seconds": 154.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.09,
      "end_seconds": 171.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.96,
      "end_seconds": 186.42,
      "duration_seconds": 14.46,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure. My neighbour said I should get it looked at. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.43,
      "end_seconds": 190.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.01,
      "end_seconds": 193.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "I've got thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.07,
      "end_seconds": 197.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.97,
      "end_seconds": 215.4,
      "duration_seconds": 16.43,
      "text": "I've had an irregular heartbeat, yes. High cholesterol, for nearly five years. I've been reading about it online and it worried me. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.95,
      "end_seconds": 218.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.18,
      "end_seconds": 222.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.5,
      "end_seconds": 234.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.53,
      "text": "I follow. Okay, I can see thin bones and an irregular heartbeat in your file as well. Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.66,
      "end_seconds": 239.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Uh, um, my grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.31,
      "end_seconds": 244.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.77,
      "end_seconds": 252.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, no, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 252.65,
      "end_seconds": 262.7,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "Actually, I remember she had some kind of reaction to diclofenac before. I couldn't swear to it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.8,
      "end_seconds": 265.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "I don't remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.58,
      "end_seconds": 274.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Okay, I'll note both of those. Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.09,
      "end_seconds": 280.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "I take amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.87,
      "end_seconds": 283.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Roughly how long on that one?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.44,
      "end_seconds": 292.95,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "For nearly five years. It's alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.72,
      "end_seconds": 296.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Roughly how long on that one?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.67,
      "end_seconds": 306.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "About about three months. It's bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day for the heart rhythm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.54,
      "end_seconds": 314.82,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.58,
      "end_seconds": 319.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.01,
      "end_seconds": 331.32,
      "duration_seconds": 10.31,
      "text": "For my cholesterol, I believe. My daughter sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.92,
      "end_seconds": 334.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.11,
      "end_seconds": 339.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.19,
      "end_seconds": 343.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.87,
      "end_seconds": 347.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.34,
      "end_seconds": 361.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Your weight and waist measurement are both above the healthy range."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.44,
      "end_seconds": 367.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.44,
      "end_seconds": 407.96,
      "duration_seconds": 29.52,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: This is probably obesity with weight-related symptoms. Another possibility is an underactive thyroid. Let's book a thyroid test to look into weight gain. I'm going to order a cholesterol test, for obesity. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Aim for a loss of half a kilo a week with smaller portions and a daily thirty-minute walk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.72,
      "end_seconds": 413.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I think the weight management service should see you too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 414.2,
      "end_seconds": 416.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.04,
      "end_seconds": 429.41,
      "duration_seconds": 9.37,
      "text": "Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently. See me again in three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.09,
      "end_seconds": 436.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 436.87,
      "end_seconds": 440.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 440.74,
      "end_seconds": 444.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}